{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "said"}, {"text": "مُوسَىٰ", "translation": "Musa"}, {"text": "لِقَوْمِهِۦ", "translation": "to his people"}, {"text": "يَـٰقَوْمِ", "translation": "O my people"}, {"text": "إِنَّكُمْ", "translation": "Indeed, you"}, {"text": "ظَلَمْتُمْ", "translation": "[you] have wronged"}, {"text": "أَنفُسَكُم", "translation": "yourselves"}, {"text": "بِٱتِّخَاذِكُمُ", "translation": "by your taking"}, {"text": "ٱلْعِجْلَ", "translation": "the calf"}, {"text": "فَتُوبُوٓا۟", "translation": "So turn in repentance"}, {"text": "إِلَىٰ", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "بَارِئِكُمْ", "translation": "your Creator"}, {"text": "فَٱقْتُلُوٓا۟", "translation": "and kill"}, {"text": "أَنفُسَكُمْ", "translation": "yourselves"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكُمْ", "translation": "That"}, {"text": "خَيْرٌۭ", "translation": "(is) better"}, {"text": "لَّكُمْ", "translation": "for you"}, {"text": "عِندَ", "translation": "with"}, {"text": "بَارِئِكُمْ", "translation": "your Creator"}, {"text": "فَتَابَ", "translation": "Then He turned"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمْ ۚ", "translation": "towards you"}, {"text": "إِنَّهُۥ", "translation": "Indeed He"}, {"text": "هُوَ", "translation": "He"}, {"text": "ٱلتَّوَّابُ", "translation": "(is) the-returning"}, {"text": "ٱلرَّحِيمُ", "translation": "the Most Merciful"}], "sahih": "And [recall] when Moses said to his people, \"O my people, indeed you have wronged yourselves by your taking of the calf [for worship]. So repent to your Creator and kill yourselves [i.e., the guilty among you]. That is best for [all of] you in the sight of your Creator.\" Then He accepted your repentance; indeed, He is the Accepting of Repentance, the Merciful."}